y meet the standard yet, as listed below."}]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"flex flex-col","style":{"gap":"var(--space-2)"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What already meets the standard"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose [&>*+*]:mt-[var(--space-4)] [&_h2]:mt-[var(--space-8)] [&_h3]:mt-[var(--space-6)]","style":{"maxWidth":"var(--measure-en)"},"children":["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Page structure. Every page has a link to skip to the main content, one main heading, subheadings in order, and a clearly separated header, main content and footer.",{"children":"Page structure. Every page has a link to skip to the main content, one main heading, subheadings in order, and a clearly separated header, main content and footer."}],["$","li","Colour. Every pair of text and button colours is checked automatically for contrast each time the site is published. The brand orange, pink and lilac are used only as backgrounds, never as text on a light background.",{"children":"Colour. Every pair of text and button colours is checked automatically for contrast each time the site is published. The brand orange, pink and lilac are used only as backgrounds, never as text on a light background."}],["$","li","Keyboard. Everything can be used with a keyboard alone, you can always see where the focus is, and the mobile menu closes with the Escape key and returns focus to the button that opened it.",{"children":"Keyboard. Everything can be used with a keyboard alone, you can always see where the focus is, and the mobile menu closes with the Escape key and returns focus to the button that opened it."}],["$","li","Size of buttons and links. Buttons and links that are not inside a sentence are at least 24 by 24 pixels, and 44 by 44 pixels on a touchscreen.",{"children":"Size of buttons and links. Buttons and links that are not inside a sentence are at least 24 by 24 pixels, and 44 by 44 pixels on a touchscreen."}],"$L10","$L11","$L12"]}]}]]}],"$L13","$L14","$L15"]}]